{"4004820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FreeStyle Football 2", "steam_appid": 4004820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freestyle Football 2</strong> is an online multiplayer soccer game featuring 5v5 matches with unique character roles and skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Own Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/b82a81a9455ade4e3b4ee0133e19d77a.poster.avif?t=1788169000\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/b82a81a9455ade4e3b4ee0133e19d77a.webm?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/b82a81a9455ade4e3b4ee0133e19d77a.mp4?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freestyle Football 2</strong> is an <strong>online multiplayer football game</strong> that combines fast-paced matches, flashy individual skills, and team play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each position has a unique role. Use a variety of strategies and skills to claim victory with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish moves and distinctive characters turn the field into a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Play Powered by Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/35e9fa3ed78fd9c0b7c1486cf2331f5e.poster.avif?t=1788169000\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/35e9fa3ed78fd9c0b7c1486cf2331f5e.webm?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/35e9fa3ed78fd9c0b7c1486cf2331f5e.mp4?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freestyle Football 2</strong> is an <strong>online multiplayer football game</strong> that combines fast-paced matches, flashy individual skills, and team play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each position has a unique role. Use a variety of strategies and skills to claim victory with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish moves and distinctive characters turn the field into a stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Formations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/86a1e3e7d9f7234eac161444ac6b631d.poster.avif?t=1788169000\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/86a1e3e7d9f7234eac161444ac6b631d.webm?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/86a1e3e7d9f7234eac161444ac6b631d.mp4?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s more than one way to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push forward with an aggressive formation to pressure your opponents, or sit back with a solid defense and strike on the counter.</p><p class=