ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring a goal is the biggest thrill in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your team’s victory with a unique celebration and make the moment yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cap off the match highlight with a stylish performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Character Has a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/991abced85c4535b54073214fcd7c355.poster.avif?t=1788169000\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/991abced85c4535b54073214fcd7c355.webm?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/991abced85c4535b54073214fcd7c355.mp4?t=1788169000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character in Freestyle Football 2 has their own background and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast, learn their stories, and dive deeper into the world of Freestyle Football 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freestyle Football 2</strong> is an online multiplayer soccer game featuring 5v5 matches with unique character roles and skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Own Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/extras/b82a81a9455ade4e3b4ee0133e19d77